'''The Eldest Queen''' (絶・古王妃飛来, ''Zetsu・Ko Ōhi Hirai'', '''Absolute・Flight of the Old Queen''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] and appears on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''', and '''16th''' of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|The Old Queen]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] - Jelly Dumpling Cat.

